.m. Jakarta time on the Rate \par                                                              Fixing Date, if the first day \par                                                              (other than a Saturday or a Sunday) \par                                                              following the Rate Fixing Date \par                                                              is not a Relevant Business Day. \par                                                             If five or four quotations are \par                                                              provided by Reference Banks as \par                                                              requested, the Reference Rate \par                                                              shall be the arithmetic mean (rounded \par                                                              to the nearest whole IDR, with \par                                                              IDR 0.5 being rounded upwards) \par                                                              of the remaining three or two \par                                                              such quotations (expressed as \par                                                              the number of IDR per one USD), \par                                                              as the case may be, after disregarding \par                                                              the highest quotation and the \par                                                              lowest quotation; provided, that \par                                                              if two or more such quotations \par                                                              are the highest such quotations, \par                                                              then only one of such quotations \par                                                              shall be disregarded; and provided \par 