ank \par                                                              and the Calculation Agent. \par                            (h) Notification:                If the Interest Amount payable \par                                                              on any Fixed Rate Interest Payment \par                                                              Date or the Redemption Amount, \par                                                              as the case may be, is calculated \par                                                              in any manner other than by utilizing \par                                                              the USD/IDR reference rate that \par                                                              appears on \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank Indonesia\f28 \uc2 \f2 's website \par                                                              (\f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.bi.go.id"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.bi.go.id}}}\uc2 \f2 ), or on Refinitiv \par                                                              Screen JISDOR Page ( or on such \par                                                              replacement page as described \par                                                              above ), or as otherwise made \par                                                              available by \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank Indonesia\f28 \uc2 \f2  (or \par                                                              its successor as administrator), \par                                                              the Global Agent on behalf of \par                                                              the Bank shall give notice as \par                                                              soon as reasonably practicable \par                                                              to the Noteholders in accordance \par                                                              with Condition 14 (No