                                  (b) it has not distributed, and \par                                                              will not distribute, the Prospectus, \par                                                              the Pricing Supplement, or any \par                                                              other offering material relating \par                                                              to the Notes in the Republic of \par                                                              Indonesia, or to Indonesian nationals, \par                                                              corporates or residents, in a \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Inter-American Development Bank\f28 \uc2 \f2  Issue of Debt -5-\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par                                                              manner which constitutes a public \par                                                              offering of the Notes under the \par                                                              laws and regulations of the Republic \par                                                              of Indonesia. \par                                       (d) Singapore:        In the case of the Notes being \par                                                              offered into Singapore in a primary \par                                                              or subsequent distribution, and \par                                                              solely for the purposes of its \par                                                              obligations pursuant to Section \par                                                              309B of the Securities and Futures \par                                                              Act (Chapter 289) of Singapore \par                                                              (the "SFA"), the Issuer has determined, \par                                             