e subject to adjustment \par                                                              as follows: if the scheduled \par                                                              date of the Rate Fixing Date \par                                                              is not a Relevant Business Day, \par                                                              then the Rate Fixing Date will \par                                                              be the first preceding day that \par                                                              is a Relevant Business Day. \par                                                              "Fixing Business Day" means \par                                                              a day (other than a Saturday \par                                                              or a Sunday) on which banks \par                                                              and \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets \par                                                              are open for business in Jakarta. \par                                                             "Fallback Provisions": Should \par                                                              no USD/IDR weighted average \par                                                              spot rate appear on \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank Indonesia\f28 \uc2 \f2 's \par                                                              website (\f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.bi.go.id"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.bi.go.id}}}\uc2 \f2 ) as the \par                                                              "Jakarta Interbank Spot Dollar \par                                                              Rate USD - IDR", or on Refinitiv \par                                                              Screen JISDOR Page (or on such \par                                                              