\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2  c.bank\uc2  pledges to defend rupiah with 'measured'  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 152 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2021\par 08:50\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2021 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 JAKARTA, March 30 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has defended the rupiah exchange rate using its 'triple \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ' mechanism in a measured amount and will continue to do so, as the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was undervalued, its head of monetary management told Reuters.\par \par \uc2 Bank Indonesia (BI) \uc2 "has been and always will be in the market to stabilise the exchange rate through the instrument of triple \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  ... which we do in a measured amount or sequence, timely and by putting forward market mechanism," Hariyadi Ramelan said by text message on Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 The "triple \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 " refers to BI's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the spot \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2 , domestic non-deliverable forward markets and purchase of government bonds dumped by foreign investors. The rupiah fell to 14,480 per dollar earlier on Tuesday, its weakest since November. (Reporting by Gayatri Suroyo; Editing by Christian Schmollinger) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2021-3-30T07:50:12.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020210330eh3u0111d\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
