ns \par                                             are the lowest quotations, then \par                                             only one of such lowest quotations \par                                             will be disregarded). \par                                             If only three or two such quotations \par                                             are provided as requested, the \par                                             USD/JPY Reference Rate shall \par                                             be determined as described above \par                                             except that the highest and \par                                             lowest quotations will not be \par                                             disregarded. \par                                             If none or only one of the Reference \par                                             Dealers provides such quotation, \par                                             the USD/JPY Reference Rate will \par                                             be determined by the Calculation \par                                             Agent in its sole discretion, \par                                             acting in good faith and in \par                                             a commercially reasonable manner. \par                                             The "USD/IDR Reference Rate" \par                                             means the spot rate of USD/IDR \par                                             at approximately 10:00 a.m. \par                                             Jakarta time expressed as the \par                                             number of IDR per one USD and \par                                             published on the Reuters Screen \par                                             "JISDOR" page (or its successor \par                                             page for the purpose of displaying \par    