her Relevant Terms \par  1.                       Listing:                              None \par  2.                       Details of Clearance System \par                            Approved by the Bank and \par                            the                                    Euroclear Bank SA/NV and \f28 \uc2 \f2 Clearstream\f28 \uc2 \f2  , \par                            Global Agent and Clearance             Luxembourg \par                            and \par                            Settlement Procedures: \par  3.                       Syndicated:                           No \par  4.                       Commissions and Concessions:          No commissions or concessions \par                                                                  are payable in respect of the \par                                                                  Notes. An affiliate of the Dealer \par                                                                  has arranged a swap with the \par                                                                  Bank in connection with this \par                                                                  transaction and will receive \par                                                                  amounts thereunder that may \par                                                                  comprise compensation. \par  5.                       Estimated Total Expenses:             None. The Dealer has agreed \par                                                                  to pay for all material expenses \par                                                                  related to the issuance of the \par                                                                  Notes. \par  6.                       Codes: \par                           (a) Common Code:                      202369847 \par                           (b) ISIN:                             XS2023698470 \par  7.                       Identity 