\par\par \b \uc2 Inter-American Development Bank Issue of Debt\b0\par\par\uc2 5,236 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Mai 2019\par 08:00\par \uc2 Regulatory News Service\par \uc2 RNS\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2019 \par \par \uc2 TIDM42BI\par \par \uc2 RNS Number : 9191Z\par \par \uc2 Inter-American Development Bank\par \par \uc2 22 May 2019\par \par \uc2 PRICING SUPPLEMENT\par \par \uc2 Inter-American Development Bank\par \par \uc2 Global Debt Program\par \par \uc2 Series No.: 553\par \par \uc2 Tranche No.: 13\par \par \uc2 IDR 450,000,000,000 7.875 percent Notes due March 14, 2023 (the "Notes") as from May 22, 2019 to be consolidated and form a single series with the Bank's IDR 950,000,000,000 7.875 percent Notes due March 14, 2023, issued on March 14, 2016 (the "Series 553 Tranche 1 Notes"), the Bank's IDR 327,250,000,000 7.875 percent Notes due March 14, 2023, issued on November 18, 2016 (the "Series 553 Tranche 2 Notes"), the Bank's IDR 334,000,000,000 7.875 percent Notes due March 14, 2023, issued on May 24, 2017 (the "Series 553 Tranche 3 Notes"), the Bank's IDR 1,332,000,000,000 7.875 percent Notes due March 14, 2023, issued on July 27, 2017 (the "Series 553 Tranche 4 Notes"), the Bank's IDR 250,000,000,000 7.875 percent Notes due March 14, 2023, issued on September 19, 2017 (the "Series 553 Tranche 5 Notes"), the Bank's IDR 1,645,000,000,000 7.875 percent Notes due March 14, 2023, issued on November 14, 2017 (the "Series 553 Tranche 6 Notes"), the Bank's IDR 800,000,000,000 7.875 percent Notes due March 14, 2023, issued on December 7, 2017 (the "Series 553 Tranche 7 Notes"), the Bank's IDR 250,000,000,000 7.875 percent Notes due March 14, 2023, issued on December 18, 2017 (the "Series 553 Tranche 8 Notes"), the Bank's IDR 670,800,000,000 7.875 percent Notes due March 14, 2023, issued on January 24, 2018 (the "Series 553 Tranche 9 Notes"), the Bank's IDR 360,000,000,000 7.875 percent Notes due March 14, 2023, issued on July 26, 2018 (the "Series 553 Tranche 10 Notes"), the Bank's IDR 850,000,000,000 7.875 percent Notes due March 14, 2023, issued on February 20, 2019 (the "Series 553 Tranche 11 Notes") and the Bank's IDR 674,000,000,000 7.875 percent Notes due March 14, 2023, issued on March 11, 2019 (the "Series 553 Tranche 12 Notes")\par \par \uc2 payable in United States Dollars\par \par \uc2 Issue Price: 103.250 percent plus 69 days' accrued interest\par \par \uc2 Application has been made for the Notes to be admitted to the Official List of the United Kingdom Listing Authority and to trading on the \uc2 London Stock Exchange plc\uc2 's Regulated Market\par \par \uc2 TD Securities\par \par \uc2 The date of this Pricing Supplement is as of May 17, 2019\par \par \uc2 Terms used herein shall be deemed to be defined as such for the purposes of the Terms and Conditions (the "Conditions") set forth in the Prospectus dated January 8, 2001 (the "Prospectus") (which for the avoidance of doubt does not constitute a prospectus for the purposes of Part VI of the United Kingdom Financial Services and Markets Act 2000 or a base prospectus for the purposes of Directive 2003/71/EC of the \uc2 European Parliament\uc2  and of the Council). This Pricing Supplement must be read in conjunction with the Prospectus. This document is issued to give details of an issue by the \uc2 Inter-American Development Bank\uc2  (the "Bank") under its Global Debt Program and to provide information supplemental to the Prospectus. Complete information in respect of the Bank and this offer of the Notes is only available on the basis of the combination of this Pricing Supplement and the Prospectus.\par \par \uc2 MiFID II product governance / Retail investors, professional investors and ECPs target market - See "General Information-Additional Information Regarding the Notes-Matters relating to MiFID II" below.\par \par \uc2 Terms and Conditions\par \par \uc2 The following items under this heading "Terms and Conditions" are the particular terms which relate to the issue the subject of this Pricing Supplement. These are the only terms which form part of the form of Notes for such issue. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par                       1.   Series No.:                      553 \par                             Tranche No.:                     13 \par                       2.   Aggregate Principal Amount:      IDR 450,000,000,000 \par                                                              As from the Issue Date, the Notes \par                                                              will be consolidated and form a \par                                                              single series with the Series 553 \par                                                              Tranche 1 Notes, the Series 553 \par                                                              Tranche 2 Notes, the Series 553 \par                                                              Tranche 3 Notes, the Series 553 \par                                                              Tranche 4 Notes, the Series 553 \par                                                              Tranche 5 Notes, the Series 553 \par                                                              Tranche 6 Notes, the Series 553 \par                                                              Tranche 7 Notes, the Series 553 \par                                                              Tranche 8 Notes, the Series 553 \par                                                              Tranche 9 Notes, the Series 553 \par                                                              Tranche 10 Notes, the Series 553 \par                                                              Tranche 11 Notes and the Series \par                                                              553 Tranche 12 Notes. \par                       3.   Issue Price:                           IDR 471,305,840,163.93 which amount \par                                                                    represents the sum of (a) 103.250 \par                                                                    percent of the Aggregate Principal \par                                                                    Amount plus (b) the amount of IDR \par                                                                     6,680,840,163.93 representing 69 \par                                                                    days' accrued interest, inclusive. \par                                                                     The Issue Price will be payable \par                                                                in USD in the amount of USD 33,004,610.66 \par                                                                     at the agreed rate of 14,280 IDR \par                                                                               per one USD. \par                       4.   Issue Date:                      May 22, 2019 \par                       5.   Form of Notes \par                             (Condition 1(a)):                Registered only, as further provided \par                                                              in paragraph 9(c) of "Other Relevant \par                                                              Terms" below. \par                       6.   Authorized Denomination(s) \par                              (Condition 1(b)):               IDR 10,000,000 and integral multiples \par                                                              thereof \par                       7.   Specified \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  \par                             (Condition 1(d)):                The lawful \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of the Republic \par                                                              of Indonesia ("Indonesian Rupiah" \par                                                              or "IDR"), provided that all payments \par                                                              in respect of the Notes will be \par                                                              made in United States Dollars ("U.S.$" \par                                                              or "USD") \par                       8.   Specified Principal Payment \par                             \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  \par                             (Conditions 1(d) and 7(h)):      USD \par                       9.   Specified Interest Payment \par                             \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2                          USD \par                             (Conditions 1(d) and 7(h)): \par                      10.   Maturity Date \par                             (Condition 6(a); Fixed            March 14, 2023 \par                             Interest Rate): \par                      11.   Interest Basis \par                             (Condition 5):                   Fixed Interest Rate (Condition \par                                                              5(I)) \par                      12.   Interest Commencement Date \par                             (Condition 5(III)):               March 14, 2019 \par                      13.   Fixed Interest Rate (Condition   Condition 5(I) as amended and supplemented \par                            5(I)):                            below, shall apply to the Notes. \par                                                              The bases of the Calculation of \par                                                              the Interest Amount, Interest Payment \par                                                              Dates and default interest are as \par                                                              set out below. \par  \par                              (a) Interest Rate:              7.875 percent per annum \par                            (b) Business Day Convention:     Following Business Day Convention \par                            (c) Fixed Rate Interest \par                             Payment Date(s):                  Annually on each March 14, commencing \par                                                               on March 14, 2020 and ending on, \par                                                               and including, the Maturity Date. \par                                                               Each Interest Payment Date is subject \par                                                               to adjustment in accordance with \par                                                               the Following Business Day Convention \par                                                               with no adjustment to the amount \par                                                               of interest otherwise calculated. \par                            (d) Interest Period:             Each period from and including each \par                                                              Interest Payment Date to but excluding \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Inter-American Development Bank Issue of Debt -2-\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par                                                              the next following Interest Payment \par                                                              Date, provided that the initial \par                                                              Interest Period will commence on \par                                                              and include the Interest Commencement \par                                                              Date, and the final Interest Period \par                                                              will end on but exclude the Maturity \par                                                              Date. \par                                     