usiness \par                                                              Days prior to the applicable Fixed \par                                                              Rate Interest Payment Date or Maturity \par                                                              Date, as the case may be. The Rate \par                                                              Fixing Date shall be subject to \par                                                              adjustment as follows: if the scheduled \par                                                              date of the Rate Fixing Date is \par                                                              not a Relevant Business Day, then \par                                                              the Rate Fixing Date will be the \par                                                              first preceding day that is a Relevant \par                                                              Business Day. \par                                                              "Fixing Business Day" means a day \par                                                              (other than a Saturday or a Sunday) \par                                                              on which banks and \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  \par                                                              markets are open for business in \par                                                              Jakarta. \par                                                             "Fallback Provisions": Should no \par                                                              USD/IDR weighted average spot rate \par                                                              appear on \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank Indonesia\f28 \uc2 \f2 's website \par                                                              (\f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.bi.go.id"}}{\fldrslt{\c